 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- `--signer` accepts an explicit `ed25519:<secret-URI>` or
+  `sr25519:<secret-URI>` prefix so a did:key agent can use its own ed25519
+  account. Unprefixed secret URIs stay sr25519. Encrypted keystores are
+  unchanged.
+
